### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Obtener todos los bolsines mock
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mock/bolsines

### Obtener un bolsin mock por numero
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mock/bolsines/101

### XTR-4500L - getBolsinLocation (OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/xtr-4500l/getBolsinLocation?numeroBolsin=101&codigoComisionMedicaOrigen=CM-CBA-01
X-API-Key: {{apiKeyXtr}}

### XTR-4500L - API key invalida (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/xtr-4500l/getBolsinLocation?numeroBolsin=101&codigoComisionMedicaOrigen=CM-CBA-01
X-API-Key: API_KEY_INVALIDA

### NavTrack QX-7A - retrieveTrackingData (OK, text/plain)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/navtrack-qx-7a/retrieveTrackingData?numeroBolsin=101&codigoComisionMedicaDestino=CM-ROS-02
X-API-Key: {{apiKeyNavTrack}}

### NavTrack QX-7A - codigo de destino no coincide (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/navtrack-qx-7a/retrieveTrackingData?numeroBolsin=101&codigoComisionMedicaDestino=CM-XXX-99
X-API-Key: {{apiKeyNavTrack}}

### GeoPulse MTR-900 - fetchCargoPositions (OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/geopulse-mtr-900/fetchCargoPositions?numeroBolsin=101
X-API-Key: {{apiKeyGeoPulse}}

### GeoPulse MTR-900 - bolsin no existe (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/geopulse-mtr-900/fetchCargoPositions?numeroBolsin=999
X-API-Key: {{apiKeyGeoPulse}}


